		{"id":"60e57ff26d1214d5","x":-520,"y":-520,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Domains of Dread.base]]\n#DomainOfDread"},
		{"id":"940d9fe382eea772","x":-236,"y":-409,"width":676,"height":349,"type":"text","text":"The void is a land filled with nothing but mist that lives in the plains of existence once in the void without a mist beacon there is now way to reach a destination, you will be stuck traveling The Void forever you do not get tired do not get hungry and cannot sleep. Most subjected to the void become the horrors within. \n\nIn some cases the void horrors can prey on the minds of those within it stealing their memories and using them to lure people deeper within The Void\n\nThis rule applies to all except those gifted by the Mistress and creator of The Void Saren Rae."}
	],
	"edges":[]
}